; ===================================================================
; FreeNova Weapon Skins & Premade Shop Configuration
; ===================================================================
; One skin per line, FLAT format:
;   <weapon> <skin_name> <v_model> <p_model> <vipOnly> <bpLevel> [coinPrice]
;
; Parameters:
;   <weapon>    : ak47 | m4a1 | deagle | awp | knife
;   <skin_name> : Display name in /skins menu (in quotes)
;   <v_model>   : First-person viewmodel (must exist in cstrike/)
;   <p_model>   : Third-person player weapon model ("-" to use default)
;   <vipOnly>   : 0 = none, 1 = VIP (FNVIP_VIP), 2 = Legend (CRX 52)
;   <bpLevel>   : Minimum CRX rank level (0 = none)
;   <coinPrice> : Coin cost to permanently purchase and unlock in /skins (0 = free / level only)
;
; 20 rows per group (plus in-plugin Default). Slot 1 AK/AWP/Knife kept for BP unlocks.
; Unique GoldSrc files first; extra rows are VIP/BP/coin variants of those files
; so GoldSrc precache does not overflow (100 unique .mdl would crash HLDS).
;
; Sources: models/fn_s1/SOURCES.txt
;
; Active skins:
